  "solution": {
    "text": "As given<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><msub><mrow><mi>&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math><br /><br />The binding energy per nucleon of a deuteron<math><mo>(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>1.1&nbsp;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> Total binding energy of one deuteron nucleus<br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>1.1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2.2&nbsp;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> The binding energy per nucleon of Helium<math><mo>(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />=7 MeV<br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> Total binding energy<br /><br /><math><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>4</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>7</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>28&nbsp;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><br />Hence, energy released in the above process<br /><br /><math><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>2.2</mn></math><br /><br />= <math><mn>28</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>–</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>4.4</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>23.6</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>",
